# Applies to the bank-sim build ONLY, whose context is the repo root.
#
# The sandbox and relay services build from `context: ./sandbox`, so Docker looks for
# sandbox/.dockerignore instead and this file is never consulted for them. That is
# what lets the `sandbox/` exclusion below coexist with a working sandbox image.
# If you ever switch that service to `context: .`, delete the `sandbox/` line first —
# otherwise the files the Dockerfile copies are silently excluded and the build fails
# in a way that reads like a missing file rather than an ignore rule.

.git
.gitignore
.claude

# Secrets never enter an image.
.env
.env.*

# Python artifacts
.venv
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Test and lint caches: regenerated locally, never useful inside an image.
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Planning docs and deliverables — not needed to run the simulator.
*.md
evidence/
artifacts/

# The orchestrator and the sandbox build separately; the sim image must not carry them.
src/
sandbox/
tests/
